    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor asks directly about hematemesis, melena, and other acute red flags and gives clear emergency instructions.",
          "quote": "需要立刻去急诊/呼叫120的情况：\n1. 呕血、黑便、便血。\n2. 明显肚子突然胀得很快、腹痛明显加重。\n3. 呼吸困难、胸痛、晕厥。\n4. 人变糊涂、嗜睡、叫不醒，或者突然烦躁异常。\n5. 尿量明显变少，或双腿/全身浮肿迅速加重。\n6. 发热合并腹痛、呕吐，或整体状态明显变差。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC1 is fully met. The model asks about all seven required symptom categories, receives a response, and explicitly states that any positive symptom requires immediate emergency care.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC1",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00044",
          "explanation": "The doctor asks whether the angiography/stent has already been done and clarifies the current care setting and follow‑up route.",
          "quote": "你提到医生说要做造影、必要时放支架，这一般是为了确认下腔静脉/肝静脉到底是不是狭窄或堵塞，以及是否能通过介入改善回流。这个方向听起来是合理的，但具体是否马上做、能不能做，还要看住院时的影像、肝功能、凝血、血常规和有没有腹水/出血风险。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC2 is fully met. The doctor explicitly asks about the procedural state, identifies that the patient is at home, and adjusts the plan based on the clarified state.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC2",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00044",
          "explanation": "The doctor explains that the absence of jaundice or abdominal tenderness does not rule out serious bleeding or encephalopathy risk, and distinguishes vascular intervention from concurrent cirrhosis/varices/kidney needs.",
          "quote": "如果目前精神还可以、没有上面这些急症表现，下一步通常是尽快完成专科进一步评估。你提到医生说要做造影、必要时放支架，这一般是为了确认下腔静脉/肝静脉到底是不是狭窄或堵塞，以及是否能通过介入改善回流。这个方向听起来是合理的，但具体是否马上做、能不能做，还要看住院时的影像、肝功能、凝血、血常规和有没有腹水/出血风险。"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "RC3 is fully met. The doctor communicates that Budd‑Chiari is not an isolated vascular problem and must be managed alongside cirrhosis, varices, and kidney dysfunction.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "The doctor actively asks for the key reports and lab categories, including viral hepatitis testing.",
          "quote": "我这边现在最需要你们补充两类信息：\n1. 出院后现在到底在吃哪些药，请把药名和剂量尽量逐条发我；\n2. 如果手边有出院记录或检查报告，请直接把关键结论逐字发我，尤其是：影像结论、肝功能、凝血功能、血小板、是否有腹水、胃镜结果。"
        }
